<title>USA: Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn glaucoma drug gets UK ok.</title>
<headline>Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn glaucoma drug gets UK ok.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn said Friday that Britain has approved Xalatan, its medicine for glaucoma.</p>
<p>&quot;This approval is an important step for Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn as this will start the process of approval of the product across Europe,&quot; the company said in a release.</p>
<p>It added that it expects approval from other EU countries in mid-1997.</p>
</text>
